## API Endpoints

### Core Operations

- `GET /balance/:wallet` – Get GCTL balance for wallet
- `GET /price` – Get current GCTL price in USDC
- `GET /price/glw` – Get current GLW price in USDC (currently fixed ratio)
- `GET /supply/circulating` – Get circulating GCTL supply (stringified bigint)
- `GET /nonce/:wallet` – Get latest used nonce for wallet
- `POST /stake` – Stake GCTL to a region
- `POST /unstake` – Unstake GCTL from a region (respects 100-epoch lockup)
- `POST /restake` – Restake GCTL between regions (linear release)
- `POST /pay-protocol-deposit-staked` – Pay protocol deposit using staked GCTL
- `GET /rewards/glw/regions` – Get GLW rewards distribution per active region

### `GET /nonce/:wallet`

```typescript
// Success
{
  wallet: string,
  lastNonce: string
}
// Error
{ error: string }
```

### Region & Wallet Queries

- `GET /region/:regionId/stake` – Total GCTL staked in region
- `GET /wallet/:wallet/region/:regionId/stake` – Wallet's stake in specific region
- `GET /wallet/:wallet/region/:regionId/unlocked` – Unlocked stake available for unstaking

### Data Listing (Paginated)

- `GET /events/minted?page=1&limit=50` – Finalized purchase events
- `GET /events/stake?page=1&limit=50` – GCTL stake events
- `GET /events/stake?page=1&limit=50&regionId=` – GCTL stake events (optionally filter by region)
- `GET /transfers/pending?page=1&limit=50` – Pending token transfers
- `GET /transfer/:txId` – Get specific transfer by transaction ID (includes failure info)
- `GET /operations/failed?page=1&limit=50` – Failed processing operations
- `GET /nonce/:wallet` – Latest used nonce for wallet
- `GET /rewards/glw/regions` – GLW rewards distribution per active region

All paginated endpoints support optional `page` (1-indexed) and `limit` (max 100) query parameters. `GET /transfers/pending` also supports an optional `type` filter.

